OL,3,AUK pupils rank highly again in
OL,4,Ainternational reading, maths and
OL,5,Ascience tests
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK pupils have performed well again in
OL,8,Finternational science, reading and
OL,9,Fmaths tests sat every three years by
OL,10,Fhundreds of thousands of teenagers
OL,11,Faround the world.
OL,13,FThe UK's performance in the Programme
OL,14,Ffor International Student Assessment
OL,15,F(Pisa) remained steady, ranking below
OL,16,Fthe highest-performing countries like
OL,17,FSingapore, Estonia and parts of China,
OL,18,Fbut ahead of the US, Australia and
OL,19,Fother major European nations.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
