OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK pupils rank highly again in
OL,4,Ainternational reading, maths and
OL,5,Ascience tests
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the Pisa report also warned of a
OL,8,Fworldwide decline in teenagers' reading
OL,9,Fskills.
OL,11,FEngland's schools minister, Georgia
OL,12,FGould, said the government wanted to
OL,13,F"build on" the positive results and "go
OL,14,Ffurther so all young people leave
OL,15,Fschool with strong literacy and
OL,16,Fnumeracy".
